    "name": {
      "value": "Greater Staff Of Earth"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Geometric patterns are etched into the smooth brown and gray surface of a staff of earth, which makes a solid thud whenever tapped against the ground. While wielding a staff of earth, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your Fortitude saves and DC against effects that Shove you or knock you prone.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- - **2nd:** expeditious excavation, pummeling rubble\n- - **3rd:** earthbind, shifting sand"
    },
